# The CMake shipyard builds and ships as shipyard-cmake (spec 2026-09-11 decision 3).
# Renovate bumps CMAKE_VERSION (github-releases Kitware/CMake). No checksum lives here: build-cmake.sh
# verifies the tarball against Kitware's own published cmake-<v>-SHA-256.txt, which vouches for bytes
# nobody here has seen yet -- a pinned hash would block the bot (conventions check 9).
CMAKE_VERSION=4.4.3
